================================================================================
GPL-3.0: Bloviator (ported from Cloud Storage)
================================================================================

Cloud Storage by Alexthe668 and Yosh
https://github.com/AlexModGuy/CloudStorage

The Bloviator was ported from Cloud Storage to Minecraft 1.21.1 and NeoForge.
The port updated the code to newer Minecraft and NeoForge APIs,
renamed and moved classes and resources into the Lollygag namespace,
removed features tied to other Cloud Storage content, and changed some
rendering and save behavior.

These files are licensed under GPL-3.0:

Code (src/main/java/momo/dev/lollygag/):
    - common/entity/BloviatorEntity.java
    - common/entity/ai/BloviatorAttackGoal.java
    - common/entity/ai/FlightMoveController.java
    - common/entity/ai/FlyAroundGoal.java
    - client/model/BloviatorModel.java
    - client/renderer/BloviatorRenderer.java
    - client/particle/BloviatorBreathParticle.java
    - client/particle/StaticLightningParticle.java

Assets (src/main/resources/assets/lollygag/):
    - textures/entity/bloviator/
    - sounds/entity/bloviator/
    - sounds.json


